# AGENT_MISSION

> Copy this file to `openspec/AGENT_MISSION.md` and customize it for your project.
> Remove this note when done.

Read `openspec/ROADMAP.md` and work through each change in order using the flow documented in CLAUDE.md (openspec-flow section).

## Mode: Autonomous

Skip per-change CHECKPOINTs. Proceed through the entire roadmap without pausing.

## Mandatory Stop

After completing all changes (or when blocked), produce this summary and stop:

```
## Session Summary

| Change | Branch (deleted) | Commits | Tests |
|--------|-----------------|---------|-------|
| <name> | feat/<name>     | N       | N passed |
```

Do not start another change unless explicitly asked.
